  "description": "Lee Min-Su is the head of the ESG team at Soya Group, a leading Korean conglomerate. He works tirelessly, aiming to leave work on time. One day, the chairman's youngest daughter, Kang Chae-Eun, joins the team, entangled in company politics, clashing with internal villains and experiencing a variety of incidents. Will Lee Min-Su ever be able to leave work on time?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
